:::

:::details 2. Bottom-up DP (table)
`dp[i]` = best using the first `i` houses, with `dp[0] = 0` and `dp[1] = nums[0]`. Then `dp[i] = max(dp[i−1], dp[i−2] + nums[i−1])`.

