:::

:::details 2. Bottom-up DP (table)
`dp[i]` for `i` from `n` down to 0 with `dp[n] = 1`, using the same two transitions.

**Java**

```java
class Solution {
    public int numDecodings(String s) {
        int n = s.length();
        int[] dp = new int[n + 2];
        dp[n] = 1;
        for (int i = n - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
            if (s.charAt(i) == '0') continue; // dp[i] stays 0
            dp[i] = dp[i + 1];
            if (i + 1 < n && (s.charAt(i) - '0') * 10 + (s.charAt(i + 1) - '0') <= 26) dp[i] += dp[i + 2];
        }
        return dp[0];
    }
}
```

